{
 "id": "reopen-browser-first-key",
 "priority": "P0",
 "title": "After Cmd-Q (Keep) and reopen with a browser page focused, a person's real keys reach the page's address bar (Cmd-L, a typed marker), and Cmd-N then Ctrl-` make a new workspace and terminal; 3 cycles",
 "why": "reopen-f4 for the lead (STATUS 5612/5646): REOPEN-F4 fixed the terminal case; this is the browser-focused case. Real HID keys after the reopen (CuaDriver), the app's focus model (debug.focus) and the frame.",
 "source": "REOPEN-F4 (reopen-f4, a02ba201c73876f53)",
 "budget_seconds": 255,
